d. Masochism, erotic or sexually oriented torture, beating or the infliction of pain; or;
e. Erotic or lewd touching, fondling or other sexual contact with an animal by a human being;
(5) Specified anatomical areas shall include the following:
a. Less than completely and opaquely covered human genitals or pubic region, cleft of the buttocks, or; female breast below a point immediately above the top of the areola; or
